    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31424" root="غبى" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُصْنٌ أَغْبَى</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَجَرَةٌ غَبْيَآءُ</span>, <i>A branch,</i> and <i>a
tree, tangled, confused,</i> or <i>dense.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُدْخُلْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى النَّاسِ فَإِنَّهُ أَغْبَى لَكَ</span> means [<i>Enter thou among
the people, for it will be</i>] <i>most concealing for thee.</i>
(TA.)

